{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThere will never be a prison big enough to lock up the spirit of a single man.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/23defc02d04732cdb38248e31b7b9997.poster.avif?t=1758650576\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/23defc02d04732cdb38248e31b7b9997.webm?t=1758650576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/23defc02d04732cdb38248e31b7b9997.mp4?t=1758650576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brain is a first-person psychological horror game where you play as John, a man after an accident who is being chased by a strange creature. Explore varied environments and immerse yourself a little more in horror with each step..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History :</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having an accident with your wife, you wake up in a psychiatric hospital without knowing why or how you got here. Explore your surroundings to discover the secrets that led you here. Your adventure will not be easy. A creature seems to have chased you and doesn't intend to let you achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Brain...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Varied levels exploring more and more the depths of horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 A soundtrack created especially for the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Two possible endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Several secrets to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/9508fef9ca799e87144df6a04006fc99.poster.avif?t=1758650576\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/9508fef9ca799e87144df6a04006fc99.webm?t=1758650576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/9508fef9ca799e87144df6a04006fc99.mp4?t=1758650576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754960?t=1758650576","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754960?t=1758650576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/95880e59666d0c4d8381a2604dbcd1b4773dc7e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758650576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/95880e59666d0c4d8381a2604dbcd1b4773dc7e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758650576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Warning: Brain is a horror game containing horrific sequences, anxiety, violence, and frustrating scenes not suitable for young audiences."},"demos":[{"appid":3754980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThere will never be a prison big enough to lock up the spirit of a single man.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph